{"id":"62ba03663f91241e","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-morse-function.md","title":"Morse Function","display":"df-morse-function — Morse Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-morse-function","aliases":["58-df-morse-function","Morse Function"],"display":"df-morse-function — Morse Function","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[58-df-tangent-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-morse-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-morse-function</span><span>Morse Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-morse-function — Morse Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd9981d8428c2629\" href=\"?note=cd9981d8428c2629\" title=\"58-df-tangent-space\">58-df-tangent-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,f,n\\in V\\land n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,f,n\\in V\\land n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M,\\mathbb R)\">\\(C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M,\\mathbb R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathcal A}f(p)\">\\(D_{\\mathcal A}f(p)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hess}_{\\mathcal A}(f,p)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hess}_{\\mathcal A}(f,p)\\)</span>（由给定光滑图册决定的元层构造）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_pM\">\\(T_pM\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd9981d8428c2629\" href=\"?note=cd9981d8428c2629\" title=\"58-df-tangent-space\">58-df-tangent-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义的元层谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morse\\text{-}function} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land f\\in C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M,\\mathbb R)\\land \\forall p\\in M\\;\\Bigl(D_{\\mathcal A}f(p)=0\\to \\ker\\bigl(\\operatorname{Hess}_{\\mathcal A}(f,p)\\bigr)=\\{0_{T_pM}\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morse\\text{-}function} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land f\\in C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M,\\mathbb R)\\land \\forall p\\in M\\;\\Bigl(D_{\\mathcal A}f(p)=0\\to \\ker\\bigl(\\operatorname{Hess}_{\\mathcal A}(f,p)\\bigr)=\\{0_{T_pM}\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The kernel condition says exactly that the Hessian bilinear form at every critical point is nondegenerate.</li>\n<li>光滑图册现在是谓词参数；这避免从只存在量化图册的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\\)</span> 中抽取未绑定的微分与 Hessian。</li>\n<li>原依赖 <code>58-df-critical-point</code> 定义的是初等嵌入的临界点，与 Morse 临界点同名但异义，故已移除。</li>\n<li>Index <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>: count of negative eigenvalues; determines the local handle type at an isolated critical point.</li>\n<li>Handle attaching: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-handle attached along sphere <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{\\lambda-1}\">\\(S^{\\lambda-1}\\)</span>; changes topology</li>\n<li>Gradient flow: trajectories between critical points; Morse complex counts trajectories</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Milnor, Morse Theory</li>\n<li>Matsumoto, A Quick Introduction to Morse Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tangent-space","status":"resolved","id":"cd9981d8428c2629","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tangent-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tangent-space","status":"resolved","id":"cd9981d8428c2629","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_pM$ (see [[58-df-tangent-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,f,n\\in V\\land n\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\mathcal A}f(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hess}_{\\mathcal A}(f,p)","display":false},{"tex":"T_pM","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morse\\text{-}function} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land f\\in C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M,\\mathbb R)\\land \\forall p\\in M\\;\\Bigl(D_{\\mathcal A}f(p)=0\\to \\ker\\bigl(\\operatorname{Hess}_{\\mathcal A}(f,p)\\bigr)=\\{0_{T_pM}\\}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"S^{\\lambda-1}","display":false}],"bytes":1969,"backlinks":[{"id":"514ed893e8fcac45","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e4cdc6123abf4dd8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)$ (five-place Morse-function predicate, see [[58-df-morse-function]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-346","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-morse-function]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-861","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-morse-function.md|58-df-morse-function]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["71fe0dc4c8613e69","cd9981d8428c2629"]}